# Source adapters

- Implement configure, validate, healthCheck, fetch, normalize.
- Advertise capabilities. The UI must not offer archive lookback the source lacks.
- No Discord or X scraping. Official APIs only.
- Adapters produce generic evidence. They do not import domain-crypto.
- One failing engine or source must not fail the whole scan.
